%S A396101 384,9524,146608,1822413,20112770,206155755,2011440896,18958443692
%N A396101 Number of fixed polycubes with n cells that have cavities (inclusions of empty space).
%C A396101 Polycubes with fewer than 11 cells cannot have cavities.
%C A396101 A cavity is a finite connected component of the complement of the polycube, i.e., empty space not reachable from outside. Fixed polycubes are counted as distinct under translation only.
%Y A396101 Cf. A357083 (free), A355966 (one-sided), A000162, A001931.
